          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Arkanitbarre",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 hætteglas Stratholme Holy Water og 150 guld til Ott i Hillsbrad Foothills.",
