    "enUS": {
      "description": "We require several things for the barding--runecloth for the lining, arcanite bars for the plating, Arthas' Tears for the spiritual attunement, and Stratholme holy water for the spiritual imbuement. Lastly, I'd charge a modest fee for the labor and for the saddle and stirrups to go with the barding.\r\n\r\nBring me these materials, and I will be able to complete your barding. I'll get to work on the saddle while you work on gathering these items.",
